*alarm* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''alarm(milliseconds)''

Schedules a SIGALRM signal to be delivered after the specified time.

*Parameters:*
- ''milliseconds'': Time in milliseconds before SIGALRM is sent, or 0 to cancel

*Returns:*
- Number: Remaining milliseconds from previous alarm, or 0 if none
- ''err'' on failure

*Misc:*
- Use ''signal()'' to set SIGALRM handler before calling alarm
- Setting new alarm cancels previous one and return remaining time
